        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Prompt List Loop\n\n1. Click \"upload yaml\" on Load Prompt List and pick a prompt file, custom_nodes/personal-utils/example_prompts.yaml is a good start.\n2. Pick your checkpoint.\n3. Run once: everything inside the loop group runs once per prompt and Save Image gets all the images as one batch.\n\nEach Get Value node reads one setting of the current prompt. Its \"default\" is used when the YAML doesn't set that key. Add more Get Value nodes for any other key you put in the YAML (sampler, denoise, lora strength, ...)."
      ]
